    <p cms-style="font-L">　　大地期货研究院</p>
<p cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">　　观点小结</p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">核心观点</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">：</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color90">偏弱震荡</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"></font></font><font cms-style="font-L">美豆收割即将完成，基金净多继续减仓；巴西播种整体顺利，雷亚尔大幅贬值增加新作出口竞争力，南涝北旱特征明显但中西部天气尚可，短期机构对新作的产量预估仍较乐观。国内到港充足，供应宽松但消费能力不足，国内外缺乏上行驱动，短期料下方空间有限，或偏弱震荡为主。</font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">现货基差：</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">中性</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color90"></font></font></font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L">国内高开机高库存，养殖亏损严重，<span id=futures_LH0><a href=http://finance.sina.com.cn/money/future/quote.html?code=LH0 class="keyword" target=_blank data-sudaclick="content_marketkeywords_p">生猪</a></span><span id=quote_LH0></span>存栏量高产能去化不足，消费仍有韧性但增量不足。整体供强需弱，基差弱势震荡。</font></font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">南美<span id=futures_A0><a href=http://finance.sina.com.cn/money/future/quote.html?code=A0 class="keyword" target=_blank data-sudaclick="content_marketkeywords_p">大豆</a></span><span id=quote_A0></span>：</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color90">偏空</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"></font></font><font cms-style="font-L">巴西新作播种整体顺畅，天气暂无炒作，新作产量乐观，雷亚尔贬值有利于成本端下降；阿根廷即将播种，新作面积增加，天气利好大豆生长，产量乐观。南美新作供应或继续宽松，增加全球大豆供应，施压明年大豆和国内<span id=futures_M0><a href=http://finance.sina.com.cn/money/future/quote.html?code=M0 class="keyword" target=_blank data-sudaclick="content_marketkeywords_p">豆粕</a></span><span id=quote_M0></span>市场。</font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">美国大豆：</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">中性</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"></font></font><font cms-style="font-L">收割即将完成，供应压力进入季节性尾部，出口面临巴西豆竞争，但中国采购和国内生柴仍利好市场，提供底部支撑。短期基金净多持续减仓，市场缺乏上行驱动。</font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">进口采购：</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">中性</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"></font></font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L">12-1</font></font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">月缺口不断缩小，明年巴西新作采购稳步进行；</font><font cms-style="font-L">Q4</font></font><font cms-style="font-L">到港仍较充足，原料端保证国内供应。</font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">大豆压榨库存：</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color90">偏空</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"></font><font cms-style="font-L">油厂开机高，豆粕供应宽松；大豆库存去化明显，但</font></font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">11-12</font><font cms-style="font-L">月到港仍比较好，或延缓大豆去库速度。豆粕下游随用随采，周度再度累库，供应压力较大。</font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">豆粕消费库存：<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color90">偏空&nbsp;</font></font><font cms-style="font-L">养殖亏损严重，豆粕随用随采为主，消费中性没有增量，豆粕库存高企，且油厂高开机仍将维持，豆粕去库之路艰难。</font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">宏观层面：</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color90">偏空 &nbsp;</font></font></font></font></font><font cms-style="font-L">雷亚尔贬值利好成本端下降。</font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">　　01、美豆继续减仓偏弱运行</p>
<p cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color240"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color240">美豆收割即将收官</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color240">+</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color240">基金减仓，美豆偏弱延续</font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color0"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color0">美豆生长进度</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">：截至</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">11</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">月</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">1</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">日当周，美豆收割完成</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">88%</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">，前周</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">79%</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">，上年同期</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">84%</font></font><font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L">，田间报告显示美豆单产好于预期。美豆收割即将收官，季节性供给压力进入尾声。</font></font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L">　　<font cms-style="font-L"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">巴西雷亚尔暴跌，巴西豆美元报价竞争力提高，挤压美豆销售。上周美盘管理基金净多持仓继续下降，基金净多由</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">9</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">月峰值的</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">20</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">万张降</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">10</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">月</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">27</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">日当周的</font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">22.6</font></font></font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold"><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">万张，拥挤交易风险明显缓解，但绝对净多仍偏高，减仓若持续将放大下行波动。</font></font></p>
<div class="img_wrapper"><img id="1" src="//n.sinaimg.cn/finance/crawl/77/w550h327/20261103/d015-f9abb15f2ee1b2d2ad008cd9f7980c86.png" alt=""><span class="img_descr"></span></div>

<p cms-style="font-L ">　　<font cms-style="font-L align-right"><font cms-style="font-L align-right">CFTC</font></font><font cms-style="font-L align-right"><font cms-style="font-L align-right">，大地期货研究院</font></font></p>
<p cms-style="font-L strong-Bold">　　<font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color240">强检验</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color240">+</font><font cms-style="font-L strong-Bold color240">中国买盘仍是最强下方支撑</font></p>
